ection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gradual uncovering of the protagonist’s past</strong> - discover who they were in life and why they ended up here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral dilemmas and human nature</strong> — choices, consequences, and actions that can’t be ignored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear storytelling</strong> - the story unfolds through exploration, details, discoveries, and your own conclusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic graphics</strong> - high-quality visuals, detailed objects, and a cold, unsettling color pale</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171670/extras/e173b8190c7fa6d67d9416b98d669804.webp?t=1782153816\" width=1432 height=2 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171670/extras/4e2e018697b22a322555d7a79f01b989.avif?t=1782153816\" width=120 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171670/extras/93bf96ff3ce7bbc9f27fe9210ddff166.avif?t=1782153816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171670/extras_big/93bf96ff3ce7bbc9f27fe9210ddff166.webp?t=1782153816 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death has come… but the journey isn’t over.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of emptiness, you find yourself in an unknown space-partly familiar, yet twisted and unstable. Rooms shift their shape, everyday objects behave unpredictably, and paths can suddenly close